<concept id="_Initiate_a_re-learning" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Initiate a re-learning process</title>
   <shortdesc>You can initiate the re-learning process manually in the SMS mobile app.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>process</keyword>
        <keyword>learning</keyword>
        <keyword>displayed</keyword>
        <keyword>motor</keyword>
        <keyword>Initiate</keyword>
        <keyword>initiate</keyword>
        <indexterm>process</indexterm>
        <indexterm>learning</indexterm>
        <indexterm>displayed</indexterm>
        <indexterm>result</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname/>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <conbody><p>You can initiate the re-learning process manually in the SMS mobile app.</p>
         <p>To initiate a re-learning process:</p>
    <ol>
    <li>Log in to the SMS mobile application.</li>
    <li><p>Tap Motors on the bottom menu.</p>
      <p>The <b>Locations</b> list is displayed.</p></li>
    <li>Select the corresponding location associated with the motor.</li>
    <li><p>From the subsequent screens, select the corresponding plant, process, and motor name.</p>
      <p>The motor’s information page is displayed.</p></li>
    <li>Tap Parameters.</li>
    <li><p>Scroll up and tap RELEARN.</p>
      <fig>
                  <title>Image64</title>
                  <image height="501" href="../media/image64.png" placement="break" width="251">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
               <p>Figure  Parameters Tab – Relearn button</p>
               <p>An alert message is displayed.</p></li>
    <li>Tap CONTINUE.</li>
    </ol>
    <section>
      <title>Result</title>
      <p>The re-learning process begins.</p>
    </section></conbody>
</concept>